  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BERSERK_RICKERT_ARM",
    "dynamic_line": "Keep the finished cannon in your pack and activate it there. The mount on your missing left hand must be free. You can fasten it with your remaining hand. I will build the mechanism if you bring the materials to this forge.",
