  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BERSERK_RICKERT_CARE",
    "dynamic_line": "Keep grit out of the hinge and change straps before they split. Here at the forge I can repair a damaged cannon that has not been installed: one steel lump and 50 charcoal. I will not ask you to tear an installed hand off; those fittings need ordinary care, not another copy.",
